+                object whose ``host`` attribute is ``realhostname``, and whose
+                ``original_host`` attribute is ``myalias``.
+
+        :param str user:
+            the login user for the remote connection. Defaults to
+            ``config.user``.
+
+        :param int port:
+            the remote port. Defaults to ``config.port``.
+
+        :param config:
