+            ``connect_kwargs`` is currently the right place to hand in paramiko
+            connection parameters such as ``pkey`` or ``key_filename``. For
+            example::
+
+                c = Connection(
+                    host="hostname",
+                    user="admin",
+                    connect_kwargs={
